"Tel: +41 (0)24 434 21 24<br/>\n"
"Hai domande? WhatsApp: +41 (0)79 622 31 97\n"
"</p>\n"
"        </body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_yearly_payment_slips
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"fully_managed\" t-value=\"sponsorships.filtered(&#x27;fully_managed&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ns\" t-value=\"namespace(correspondents = object.env[&#x27;recurring.contract&#x27;])\"/>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"is_payer\" t-value=\"partner in sponsorships.mapped(&quot;partner_id&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-foreach=\"sponsorships\" t-as=\"s\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"gp\" t-value=\"s.mapped(s.send_gifts_to)\"/>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"gp == partner\">\n"
"            % set ns.correspondents = ns.correspondents + s\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payers\" t-value=\"partner.mapped(&#x27;contracts_paid&#x27;).intersect(sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_modes\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;payment_mode_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"bvr\" t-value=\"payment_modes.intersect(object.env.ref(&#x27;sponsorship_switzerland.payment_mode_bvr&#x27;))\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"op\" t-value=\"payment_modes.intersect(object.env.ref(&#x27;sponsorship_switzerland.payment_mode_permanent_order&#x27;))\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"months_paid\" t-value=\"max(sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;months_paid&#x27;))\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"fully_managed.union(ns.correspondents).mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;many children&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
" <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"payers and (bvr or op)\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"fully_managed.union(ns.correspondents, payers).mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"        <img src=\"https://compassion.ch/medias/banners/CC-EC0534-MyLastDay-01-2506.jpg\" alt=\"merci pour votre soutien\" style=\"display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 60px; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; height: auto;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>We wish you and your loved ones a happy new year full of hope!</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <b>Thank you for choosing to invest in <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>’s life.</b> Your commitment and support will have a lasting impact on <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> life and <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> loved ones, just as it did for Jennifer and so many other children in need.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Jennifer still remembers the very first time she walked into the Compassion child development center. “I was seven. I felt scared and shy. They served us a warm meal – rice, chicken, and lentils – and I can still remember its smell. From that moment on, I felt at home.”\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    But what changed her life wasn’t just hot meals and school supplies. It was  a caring community, the presence of the Church, and faith slowly taking root in her heart. Every day, the staff gently spoke truth over her life: “You are loved. You are precious. God has a purpose for you.”\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"    Today, Jennifer is studying family social work and has returned as a teacher to the very Compassion center that once welcomed her.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p/>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  <b>Attached you will find:</b>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"bvr and is_payer\">\n"
"        <li>\n"
"            payment slips for your sponsorship for the year <t t-out=\"str(datetime.date.today().year)\"></t>\n"
"        </li>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        three additional slips per sponsored child, should you wish to bless them with a birthday gift, support <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>’s family, or contribute to the child development center during the year <t t-out=\"str(datetime.date.today().year)\"></t>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"   <t t-if=\"bvr and is_payer\">\n"
"<p>\n"
"    You also have the option to set up a standing order for your sponsorship contributions if you wish.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Please note that any “gift” donations are entirely optional - there is absolutely no obligation. Your sponsorship alone is already a beautiful and generous gift! If you happen to misplace your payment slips or would like additional ones, please don’t hesitate to contact us at 031 552 21 25 or at info@compassion.ch.\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"    We remain at your disposal for any further questions regarding your sponsorship.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <b>Thank you for being part of the Compassion family.</b> Your generosity, together with other sponsors and the work of more than <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> child development centers in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> countries, is bringing hope and encouragement to <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> million children today.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"   Warm regards,\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.sudo().signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"% endif</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29 or not partner.title\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"te\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;te&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;tu&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tua\" t-value=\"&quot;vostra&quot; if plural else &quot;tua&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tuo\" t-value=\"&quot;vostro&quot; if plural else &quot;tuo&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tuoi\" t-value=\"&quot;vostri&quot; if plural else &quot;tuoi&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tue\" t-value=\"&quot;vostre&quot; if plural else &quot;tue&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ti\" t-value=\"&quot;vi&quot; if plural else &quot;ti&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"fully_managed\" t-value=\"sponsorships.filtered(&#x27;fully_managed&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ns\" t-value=\"namespace(correspondents = object.env[&#x27;recurring.contract&#x27;])\"/>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"is_payer\" t-value=\"partner in sponsorships.mapped(&quot;partner_id&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-foreach=\"sponsorships\" t-as=\"s\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"gp\" t-value=\"s.mapped(s.send_gifts_to)\"/>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"gp == partner\">\n"
"            % set ns.correspondents = ns.correspondents + s\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payers\" t-value=\"partner.mapped(&#x27;contracts_paid&#x27;).intersect(sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_modes\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;payment_mode_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"bvr\" t-value=\"payment_modes.intersect(object.env.ref(&#x27;sponsorship_switzerland.payment_mode_bvr&#x27;))\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"op\" t-value=\"payment_modes.intersect(object.env.ref(&#x27;sponsorship_switzerland.payment_mode_permanent_order&#x27;))\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"months_paid\" t-value=\"max(sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;months_paid&#x27;))\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"fully_managed.union(ns.correspondents).mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;vostri figlioli&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"payers and (bvr or op)\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"fully_managed.union(ns.correspondents, payers).mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;vostri figlioli&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_unacceptable_conditions&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"        <img src=\"https://compassion.ch/medias/banners/CC-EC0534-MyLastDay-01-2506.jpg\" alt=\"merci pour votre soutien\" style=\"display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 60px; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; height: auto;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Auguriamo a <t t-out=\"te\"></t> e ai <t t-out=\"tuoi\"></t> cari un felice anno nuovo pieno di speranza!</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <b>Grazie per aver scelto di investire nel migliorare la vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.</b> Il tuo impegno e il tuo sostegno cambieranno per sempre la vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> e dei suoi cari, come è avvenuto per Jennifer e a tanti altri bambini bisognosi.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Jennifer ricorda il suo primo giorno al centro di sviluppo infantile di Compassion: «Avevo sette anni. Ero spaventata e timida. Ci hanno servito un pasto caldo: riso, pollo e lenticchie - ne ricordo ancora il profumo. Fin dall'inizio mi sono sentita a casa\".\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Ciò che ha cambiato la sua vita non sono stati solo i pasti caldi e il materiale scolastico. È stata la comunità, la Chiesa e la fede che cresceva nel suo cuore. I collaboratori del centro glielo ricordavano ogni giorno: «Sei amata. Sei preziosa. Dio ha un piano per te».\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"    Oggi Jennifer studia assistenza sociale familiare e lavora come insegnante nel centro Compassion che lei stessa ha frequentato.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <b>In allegato <t t-out=\"&#x27;troverete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;troverai&#x27;\"></t>:</b>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"bvr and is_payer\">\n"
"        <li>\n"
"            i bollettini di versamento del <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> sostegno a distanza per l’anno <t t-out=\"str(datetime.date.today().year)\"></t>.\n"
"        </li>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        tre bollettini di versamento per ogni bambino sostenuto, da utilizzare per eventuali regali di compleanno a <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>, donazioni alla sua famiglia o al centro di sviluppo infantile per l'anno <t t-out=\"str(datetime.date.today().year)\"></t>.\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"bvr and is_payer\">\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Se lo desider<t t-out=\"&#x27;ate, avete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;i, hai&#x27;\"></t> anche la possibilità di impostare un ordine permanente per il contributo del sostegno.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Il versamento delle donazioni «regalo» è facoltativo e non costituisce un obbligo. Il <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> sostegno è già un dono meraviglioso! Se doves<t t-out=\"&#x27;te&#x27; if plural else &#x27;si&#x27;\"></t> smarrire i <t t-out=\"tuoi\"></t> bollettini di versamento o desideras<t t-out=\"&#x27;te&#x27; if plural else &#x27;si&#x27;\"></t> riceverne altri, non esita<t t-out=\"&#x27;t&#x27; if plural else &#x27;r&#x27;\"></t>e a contattarci al numero 031 552 21 24 o all’indirizzo e-mail info@compassion.ch.\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"    Rimaniamo a <t t-out=\"tua\"></t> disposizione per qualsiasi ulteriore domanda relativa al <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> sostegno!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Siamo grati che <t t-out=\"&#x27;facciate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tu faccia&#x27;\"></t> parte della famiglia di Compassion. Grazie a <t t-out=\"te\"></t>, agli altri sostenitori e agli oltre <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> centri di sviluppo infantile presenti in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> Paesi, attualmente <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> milioni di bambini ricevono sostegno e incoraggiamento.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <div style=\"margin-top: 20px;\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.sudo().signature\"></t>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_wrpr_welcome
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;).get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine + &#x27;n Patenkindern&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
" <t t-set=\"my_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://stage.compassion.ch/im_livechat/support/2&quot;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>So schön, <t t-out=\"&quot;ihr gehört&quot; if plural else &quot;du gehörst&quot;\"></t> nun zur weltweiten Compassion-Familie! Herzlich wilkommen!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p><t t-out=\"&quot;Erfahrt&quot; if plural else &quot;Erfahre&quot;\"></t> hier mehr dazu: <a href=\"https://vimeo.com/710323229/b9f3f472c5\">https://vimeo.com/710323229/b9f3f472c5</a>\n"
"</p><div>\n"
"<t t-if=\"sum(sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;total_amount&#x27;)) and partner in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;)\">\n"
"    <p>Damit <t t-out=\"&quot;ihr eure&quot; if plural else &quot;du deine&quot;\"></t> Spende für die <t t-out=\"sponsorships.get(&#x27;Patenschaft&#x27;)\"></t> einrichten <t t-out=\"&quot;könnt, findet ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;kannst, findest du&quot;\"></t> hier den Einzahlungsschein: <a t-attf-href=\"https://stage.compassion.ch/report/pdf/report_compassion.single_bvr_sponsorship/{{str(sponsorships[:1].id)}}\">Einzahlungsschein</a>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"partner.parent_consent == &#x27;not_submitted&#x27;\">\n"
"<br/>und die Einverständniserklärung, die wir von <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>n Eltern unterschrieben benötigen:\n"
"<a href=\"https://stage.compassion.ch/partner_compassion/static/src/img/parental_consent_de_DE.pdf\">https://stage.compassion.ch/partner_compassion/static/src/img/parental_consent_de_DE.pdf</a>\n"
"         </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div><p>In den kommenden Tagen werden wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> weitere wichtige Informationen zum Start der <t t-out=\"sponsorships.get(&#x27;Patenschaft&#x27;)\"></t> per SMS zukommen lassen. Heute sind wir bei Schritt 1/8.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Liebe Grüsse\n"
"<br/>Sarah\n"
"<br/>Tel: +41 (0)31 552 21 21\n"
"<br/>Fragen? <t t-out=\"&quot;Meldet ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;Melde dich&quot;\"></t> per Chat bei uns: <a t-attf-href=\"{{my_url}}\"><t t-out=\"my_url\"></t></a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"        </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped('partner_id') and len(sponsorships.filtered('period_paid')) != len(sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('child_id').get_list('preferred_name', 3, 'n Patenkindern', False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"chat_url\" t-value=\"'https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/im_livechat/support/3'\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"survey\" t-value=\"object.env.ref('partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_onboarding_survey').get_start_url()\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Che bello, ora fai parte della grande famiglia di Compassion! Benvenut<t t-out=\"'o' if partner.gender == 'M' else 'a'\"/>!\n"
"</p><p>\n"
"    Per saperne di più, clicca qui: <a href=\"https://vimeo.com/compassionswitzerland/writeandpray-it?share=copy\">video</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"payer\">\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Per effettuare la tua donazione per il sostegno, trovi il bollettino di versamento <a href=\"http://mycompassion.ch/my/download/sponsorship_bvr\">cliccando qui</a> e il modulo di consenso dei genitori da far firmare ai tuoi genitori <a href=\"http://compassion.ch/medias/write_pray/parental_consent_form_WP_it.pdf\">qui</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Nei prossimi giorni ti invieremo tramite SMS ulteriori informazioni importanti sull'inizio del tuo sostegno.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie e a presto!<br/>\n"
"    Il team di Compassion<br/>\n"
"    Tel: +41 (0)24 434 21 24<br/>\n"
"    Hai domande? Chatta con noi su MyCompassion: <a t-attf-href=\"{{chat_url}}\"><t t-out=\"chat_url\"/></a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_zoom_link
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"session\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thank you for registering for the video conference for new sponsors. We look forward to meeting you online on\n"
"    <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;dd. MMMM&#x27;)\"></t>, showing you what your sponsorship is doing, and answering your\n"
"    questions.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Here is the link to attend the meeting at <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;HH:mm&#x27;)\"></t>: <t t-out=\"session.link\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We'll be happy if you turn on the camera at the beginning of the meeting so we can see you. You can also turn\n"
"    it off afterwards if you prefer. The sound quality is best if all participants mute their microphone when they are\n"
"    not speaking.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    You can log in ten minutes before the meeting starts. If you have any technical questions, please feel free to\n"
"    contact me in advance.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Warm regards and see you soon!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"session\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"plural\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"iscritto\" t-value=\"&#x27;iscritti&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-elif=\"partner.gender == &#x27;F&#x27;\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"iscritto\" t-value=\"&#x27;iscritta&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"iscritto\" t-value=\"&#x27;iscritto&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie per <t t-out=\"&#x27;esservi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;esserti&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"iscritto\"></t> alla videoconferenza per nuovi sostenitori.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Saremo felici di <t t-out=\"&#x27;incontrarvi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;incontrarti&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;dd. MMMM&#x27;)\"></t> per parlare dell'impatto del <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> sostegno e rispondere a tutte le <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostre&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tue&#x27;\"></t> domande.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Ecco il link per partecipare alla riunione di <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;dd. MMMM&#x27;)\"></t> alle ore <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;HH:mm&#x27;)\"></t>: <a t-attf-href=\"{{session.link}}\"><t t-out=\"session.link\"></t></a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Ti&#x27;\"></t> proponiamo di attivare la telecamera all'inizio dell'incontro in modo che possiamo <t t-out=\"&#x27;vedervi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;vederti&#x27;\"></t>. Se lo <t t-out=\"&#x27;desiderate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;desideri&#x27;\"></t>, <t t-out=\"&#x27;potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;puoi&#x27;\"></t> disattivarla in seguito. Per una qualità audio ottimale, <t t-out=\"&#x27;vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;ti&#x27;\"></t> chiediamo di disattivare il microfono e di attivarlo solamente quando <t t-out=\"&#x27;prendete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;prendi&#x27;\"></t> la parola.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Potrete collegarvi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Potrai collegarti&#x27;\"></t> a partire dalle 19:50. Non <t t-out=\"&#x27;esitate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;esitare&#x27;\"></t> a contattarci se <t t-out=\"&#x27;avete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hai&#x27;\"></t> domande di carattere tecnico.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti e a presto!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_zoom_registration_confirmation
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"session\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().zoom_session_id\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thank you for your interest in the informational and sharing video conference for new sponsors.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    The meeting will take place on <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;dd. MMMM&#x27;)\"></t> at <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;,\n"
"    &#x27;HH:mm&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We will send you all the information regarding the connection to this meeting a few days before by email or will\n"
"    inform you in case you have chosen a later date.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Warm regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"session\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().zoom_session_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Ti&#x27;\"></t> ringraziamo per il <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> interesse alla videoconferenza di informazione e di condivisione per nuovi sostenitori.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    L'incontro online si terrà <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;dd. MMMM&#x27;)\"></t> alle ore <t t-out=\"session.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;HH:mm&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Qualche giorno prima, <t t-out=\"&#x27;vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;ti&#x27;\"></t> invieremo via e-mail tutte le informazioni per <t t-out=\"&#x27;potervi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;poterti&#x27;\"></t> collegare. Se <t t-out=\"&#x27;avete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hai&#x27;\"></t> scelto l’opzione di una data successiva, <t t-out=\"&#x27;vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;ti&#x27;\"></t> contatteremo per <t t-out=\"&#x27;informarvi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;informarti&#x27;\"></t> delle prossime date disponibili.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_birthday_reminder
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"He\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;He&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"he\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"his\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"him\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"age\" t-value=\"child.age + 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"month\" t-value=\"child.get_date(&#x27;birthdate&#x27;, &#x27;date_month&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"hold_gifts\" t-value=\"child.get_hold_gifts()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner_name\" t-value=\"partner.firstname and (partner.firstname + &#x27; &#x27; + partner.lastname) or partner.name\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"already_paid\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;birthday_paid&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"paid_date\" t-value=\"already_paid and already_paid[0] and already_paid[0].get_date(&#x27;date_partner_paid&#x27;, &#x27;date_full&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"send_gifts_to\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(sponsorships[0].send_gifts_to)[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"does_write\" t-value=\"partner == sponsorships[0].correspondent_id and 23 not in partner.category_id.ids\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    It's <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>'s birthday on <t t-out=\"month\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;He&#x27;)\"></t> will be <t t-out=\"age\"></t> years old this year.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We invite you to write a few words of encouragement to <t t-out=\"him\"></t> online via <a href=\"https://www.mycompassion.ch\">MyCompassion</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Imagine the joy when <t t-out=\"he\"></t> receives a letter from you!*\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"not hold_gifts and not already_paid and send_gifts_to == partner\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        If you would also like to give <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> a present, you can do so using the attached payment slip or <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/geschenkformular\">online</a>.*\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thank you for making a difference in <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>'s life.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Kind regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature \"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    *It is possible that this message crossed with your letter or donation.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"boy\" t-value=\"child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"his\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"him\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"month\" t-value=\"child.get_date(&#x27;birthdate&#x27;, &#x27;date_month&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"hold_gifts\" t-value=\"child.get_hold_gifts()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner_name\" t-value=\"partner.firstname and (partner.firstname + &#x27; &#x27; + partner.lastname) or partner.name\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"te\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;te&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ti\" t-value=\"&quot;vi&quot; if plural else &quot;ti&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;tu&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tua\" t-value=\"&quot;vostra&quot; if plural else &quot;tua&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tuo\" t-value=\"&quot;vostro&quot; if plural else &quot;tuo&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tue\" t-value=\"&quot;vostre&quot; if plural else &quot;tue&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"already_paid\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;birthday_paid&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"paid_date\" t-value=\"already_paid and already_paid[0] and already_paid[0].get_date(&#x27;date_partner_paid&#x27;, &#x27;date_full&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"send_gifts_to\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(sponsorships[0].send_gifts_to)[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"does_write\" t-value=\"partner == sponsorships[0].correspondent_id and 23 not in partner.category_id.ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"whatsapp_signature\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;whatsapp_signature&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"month.startswith(&quot;11&quot;) or month.startswith(&quot;8&quot;)\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"date\" t-value=\"&quot;L&#x27;&quot; + month\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-elif=\"month.startswith(&quot;1 &quot;)\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"date\" t-value=\"&quot;Il 1°&quot; + month[1:]\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"date\" t-value=\"&quot;Il &quot; + month\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;sms&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"date\"></t>, sarà il compleanno di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Immagina la gioia di ricevere gli auguri di compleanno che arrivano dall'altra parte del mondo. Sapere che qualcuno pensa a te e che non sei solo è un regalo dal valore inestimabile.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Puoi scriver<t t-out=\"&#x27;gli&#x27; if boy else &#x27;le&#x27;\"></t> su MyCompassion.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"partner.has_majority or partner.parent_consent == &quot;approved&quot;\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Se desideri fare una donazione per un regalo di compleanno a <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>, <a t-attf-href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/formulario-per-regalo\">puoi farlo qui</a>.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Grazie per aver investito nel migliorare la sua vita.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Buona giornata e a presto!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p><t t-out=\"whatsapp_signature\"></t></p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"date\"></t>, sarà il compleanno di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>, quest'anno compirà <t t-out=\"child.age + 1\"></t> anni.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"does_write\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"&#x27;Dedichereste&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Dedicheresti&#x27;\"></t> qualche minuto per scriver<t t-out=\"&#x27;gli&#x27; if boy else &#x27;le&#x27;\"></t> un breve messaggio e far<t t-out=\"&#x27;gli&#x27; if boy else &#x27;le&#x27;\"></t> sapere che <t t-out=\"&#x27;pensate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;pensi&#x27;\"></t> a <t t-out=\"&#x27;lui&#x27; if boy else &#x27;lei&#x27;\"></t>? <t t-out=\"&#x27;Potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Puoi&#x27;\"></t> farlo rapidamente e facilmente su MyCompassion.ch. Questa piattaforma <t t-out=\"ti\"></t> permette di avere sempre a portata di mano le foto, le lettere e le informazioni su <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"&#x27;Immaginate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Immagina&#x27;\"></t> la <t t-out=\"&#x27;loro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;sua&#x27;\"></t> gioia nel ricevere una <t t-out=\"tua\"></t> lettera.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"not hold_gifts and not already_paid and send_gifts_to == partner\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Se <t t-out=\"&quot;desiderate&quot; if plural else &quot;desideri&quot;\"></t> far<t t-out=\"&#x27;gli&#x27; if boy else &#x27;le&#x27;\"></t> un regalo di compleanno, <t t-out=\"&#x27;potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;puoi&#x27;\"></t> utilizzare il bollettino di versamento allegato o andare direttamente online\n"
"            <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/formulario-per-regalo/\">\n"
"                compassion.ch/it/formulario-per-regalo/\n"
"            </a>.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Grazie per il contributo che <t t-out=\"&#x27;state&#x27; if plural else &#x27;stai&#x27;\"></t> dando alla vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Cari saluti e a presto,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"></t>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        *È possibile che questo messaggio sia stato inviato contemporaneamente a una lettera o una donazione per un regalo di compleanno da parte <t t-out=\"tua\"></t>. In questo caso, <t t-out=\"&#x27;potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;puoi&#x27;\"></t> semplicemente ignorarlo. Grazie per la comprensione.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_wrpr_dossier
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;) and len(sponsorships.filtered(&#x27;period_paid&#x27;)) != len(sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Welcome to the Compassion Family!\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Thank you for your commitment to <t t-out=\"&#x27;another &#x27; if sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;parent_id&#x27;) or len(object.partner_id.sponsorship_ids) != len(sponsorships) else &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>child in poverty. You have made a great decision! You will be changing the life of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> family.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    In a few days time, <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> will learn that <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;has&#x27;)\"></t> a sponsor. It will be a day of joy for <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> and <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> family.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    So that the sponsorship runs smoothly, enclosed you will find some important information and documents to help you get started:\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        1 photo of your sponsored child\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        1 dossier with practical information about this sponsorship\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        1 letter template so that you can introduce yourself to the child\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        1 sheet of labels to use each time you write letters to the child (1 label each with a reference number to whatever you send-- each letter, card, drawing, booklet, etc.)\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    The special feature of a “Write &amp; Pray” sponsorship is teamwork. The sponsored child will come to know you as <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> sponsor.  We are depending on you to pray for the child and to write to <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> at least 2x per year while another donor provides the <t t-out=\"&#x27;missing &#x27; if payer else &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>financial support for <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;the child&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    We wish you and <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> much joy and blessing in corresponding with one another!\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact us.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Best regards,\n"
"</p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"lui\" t-value=\"child.get(&#x27;lui&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"partner in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;) and len(sponsorships.filtered(&#x27;period_paid&#x27;)) != len(sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"young\" t-value=\"not plural\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"te\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;te&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;tu&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tua\" t-value=\"&quot;vostra&quot; if plural else &quot;tua&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tuo\" t-value=\"&quot;vostro&quot; if plural else &quot;tuo&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tue\" t-value=\"&quot;vostre&quot; if plural else &quot;tue&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ti\" t-value=\"&quot;vi&quot; if plural else &quot;ti&quot;   \"/>\n"
"    \n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"   <t t-if=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;parent_id&#x27;) or len(object.partner_id.sponsorship_ids) != len(sponsorships)\">\n"
"\t<t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Grazie mille, <t t-out=\"&quot;avete&quot; if plural else &quot;hai&quot;\"></t> deciso di investire nella vita di <t t-out=\"&quot;un altro bambino&quot; if len(child) == 1 else &quot;altri bambini&quot;\"></t>!\n"
"\t</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"\t<t t-out=\"partner.get(&#x27;Benvenuto&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"partner.firstname\"></t>! Che bello, ora <t t-out=\"&quot;fate&quot; if plural else &quot;fai&quot;\"></t> parte della famiglia di Compassion!\n"
"</t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"   Insieme a <t t-out=\"te\"></t>, stiamo attualmente liberando più di <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> milioni di bambini dalla povertà estrema con circa <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> chiese partner in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> paesi. Insieme doniamo ai bambini la possibilità di vivere con speranza e futuro.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"not payer\">\n"
"<p>\n"
"   Tra qualche giorno <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;will be&#x27;)\"></t> informat<t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;accord_o_a&#x27;)\"></t> di avere finalmente un sostenitore. Sarà un giorno di gioia per <t t-out=\"lui\"></t> e <t t-out=\"&quot;la sua famiglia&quot; if len(child) == 1 else &quot;le loro famiglie&quot;\"></t>.\n"
"   </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"   Per iniziare bene il sostegno di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>, alleghiamo alcune informazioni importanti: \n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <ul>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    1 foto <t t-out=\"&#x27;di &#x27; + firstname if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;ogni bambino&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    1 dossier con informazioni pratiche\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    1 carta per <t t-out=\"&quot;presentarvi&quot; if plural else &quot;presentarti&quot;\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;al bambino&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;ai bambini&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    1 foglio di etichette da utilizzare per tutta la corrispondenza (da incollare su lettere, carte, disegni, adesivi, su tutto il materiale cartaceo che ci <t t-out=\"&quot;invierete&quot; if plural else &quot;invierai&quot;\"></t> per corriere).\n"
"   </li>\n"
"  </ul>\n"
"  La particolarità del sostegno «Write &amp; Pray» è il lavoro di squadra. Contiamo su di <t t-out=\"te\"></t> per pregare per <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>, e scrivere almeno due volte l'anno.\n"
"    \n"
"<p>\n"
"  <t t-if=\"payer\">\n"
"\tUn altro donatore coprirà il saldo del sostegno finanziario per <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>. Dopo l'arrivo della prima donazione per il sostegno a distanza, <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>, <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;will be&#x27;)\"></t> informat<t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;accord_o_a&#x27;)\"></t> avere finalmente un sostenitore!  <t t-out=\"&quot;Riuscite&quot; if plural else &quot;Riesci&quot;\"></t> a immaginare la grande gioia di questa notizia?\n"
"\t</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"\tUn altro donatore fornirà supporto finanziario per <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"</t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  Grazie mille per aver preso una generosa decisione per <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>! \n"
"    </p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  Auguriamo a entrambi gioia e benedizione, e <t t-out=\"ti\"></t> ricordiamo che se <t t-out=\"&quot;avete&quot; if plural else &quot;hai&quot;\"></t> domande siamo qui per <t t-out=\"te\"></t>. Insieme cambiamo il mondo! Un bambino alla volta.\n"
" </p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"A presto!\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_invalid_email
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"   \n"
"<t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-if=\"sponsorships\">\n"
"\tThank you for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"sponsorships.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"></t> with a sponsorship.\n"
"\t</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"\tThank you for your concern for children living in extreme poverty.\n"
"</t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We have sent you an e-mail to the following address: <t t-out=\"partner.email or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t> . Unfortunately, it seems to not have reached you. Have you changed your email address or did the email end up in your spam?\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   May we ask you to contact us to give us your new email address or that you add \"info@compassion\" to your contact list, in case the email reached you? You can reach us by phone at 031 552 21 21 or write us to info@compassion.ch.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Once again, thank you for your commitment. Together we are able to tranform the lives of currently 2 million children in 25 countries in a sustainable way.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Sincerely,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   PS: Do you already have the Compassion app? With it you always have your sponsored child's pictures, letters and all information at hand. And the letter writing is made even easier. Download here: www.compassion.ch/app\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids.filtered(&#x27;is_active&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"sponsorships\">\n"
"        Grazie per aver investito nel migliorare la vita di bambini che vivono in condizioni di estrema povertà.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Grazie per il <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> impegno a favore dei bambini che vivono in condizioni di estrema povertà.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Ti&#x27;\"></t> abbiamo inviato un'e-mail all'indirizzo <t t-out=\"partner.invalid_mail or partner.email\"></t>. <t t-out=\"&#x27;Avete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Hai&#x27;\"></t> cambiato indirizzo e-mail o è finita nella posta indesiderata (spam)?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Ti&#x27;\"></t> preghiamo di fornirci un indirizzo e-mail valido o aggiungere l'indirizzo info@compassion.ch ai <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostri&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuoi&#x27;\"></t> contatti.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Ancora una volta, grazie di cuore per il <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> impegno con Compassion. Insieme, stiamo contribuendo a cambiare in modo duraturo la vita di <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> milioni di bambini bisognosi.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti,\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_address_change
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"address\" t-value=\"partner.short_address\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for investing in the lives of children in extreme poverty.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We have sent you mail to the following address:\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"address\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Unfortunately, the letter did not reach you. Have you moved? If so, we would be pleased if you could tell us your new address.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Your support of children in extreme poverty is valuable.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   At Compassion, we believe that you are giving them the chance to live a dignified and meaningful life. <t t-out=\"object.success_sentence or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Once again, thank you for your commitment so that together we can positively transform the lives of currrently more than 2 million children in 25 countries.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Sincerely,\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.user_id.preferred_name\"></t> <t t-out=\"object.user_id.lastname\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.user_id.employee_ids.department_id.name\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.user_id.company_id.address_name\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"address\" t-value=\"partner.short_address\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Purtroppo, la posta che <t t-out=\"&#x27;vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;ti&#x27;\"></t> abbiamo inviato al seguente indirizzo è tornata indietro:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"address\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Vi siete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Ti sei&#x27;\"></t> trasferit<t t-out=\"&#x27;i&#x27; if plural else (&#x27;o&#x27; if partner.gender == &#x27;M&#x27; else &#x27;a&#x27;)\"></t>?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    In tal caso <t t-out=\"&#x27;vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;ti&#x27;\"></t> preghiamo di comunicarci il <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> nuovo indirizzo.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie per aver investito nel migliorare la vita dei bambini che vivono in povertà. Insieme, stiamo contribuendo a cambiare in modo duraturo la vita di oltre <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> milioni di bambini in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> Paesi del Sud.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti e a presto,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_birthday_1day_reminder
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"one\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"letters\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;correspondence&#x27;].search([(&#x27;sponsorship_id&#x27;, &#x27;in&#x27;, sponsorships.ids), (&#x27;scanned_date&#x27;, &#x27;&gt;=&#x27;, (datetime.datetime.now() - relativedelta(months=3)).strftime(&#x27;%Y-%m-%d&#x27;)), (&#x27;direction&#x27;, &#x27;=&#x27;, &#x27;Supporter To Beneficiary&#x27;)])\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"month\" t-value=\"child.get_date(&#x27;birthdate&#x27;, &#x27;date_month&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"already_paid\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;birthday_paid&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"paid_date\" t-value=\"already_paid and already_paid[0] and already_paid[0].get_date(&#x27;date_partner_paid&#x27;, &#x27;date_full&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"hold_gifts\" t-value=\"child.get_hold_gifts()\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"send_gifts_to\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(sponsorships[0].send_gifts_to)[0]\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"does_write\" t-value=\"partner == sponsorships[0].correspondent_id and 23 not in partner.category_id.ids\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Tomorrow, it’s <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"name\"></t>'s birthday! Thanks to your sponsorship, <t t-out=\"name\"></t> has been able to enjoy another year at the project.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-if=\"does_write and not letters\">\n"
"\tIf you haven’t sent a greeting yet, would you be willing to send <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> some birthday wishes? A few heartfelt and appreciative words encourage the children greatly and demonstrates that they are valuable.  You can write him online at:\n"
"   <a t-attf-href=\"https://my.compassion.ch/r/fVN?email={{partner.email}}&amp;pname={{partner.name}}&amp;sponsor_ref={{partner.ref}}&amp;child_ref={{child.local_id if len(child) == 1 else ''}}\">\n"
"    www.compassion.ch/ecrire\n"
"   </a>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   </t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"not hold_gifts and not already_paid and send_gifts_to == partner\">\n"
"\tDid you know you can also send a birthday present to <t t-out=\"name\"></t>? If you would like, you can still\n"
"   <a t-attf-href=\"https://my.compassion.ch/r/njq?fund_code=Anniversaire&amp;last_name={{partner.lastname}}&amp;first_name={{partner.firstname}}&amp;street={{partner.street}}&amp;zipcode={{partner.zip}}&amp;city={{partner.city}}&amp;email={{partner.email}}&amp;child_ref={{child.local_id if len(child) == 1 else ''}}&amp;country={{partner.country_id.name}}\">\n"
"    send your sponsored child a birthday present\n"
"   </a>\n"
"   (between 20.-100 CHF.-maximum).  Together, with an employee from the project who knows <t t-out=\"name\"></t> well; a useful present or presents will be chosen and purchased. Just imagine the joy on their face in a few months when they realize you have sent them a birthday gift!\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   </t>\n"
"   Thank you for investing in the life of <t t-out=\"name\"></t>. In partnership with you and more than one million sponsors worldwide, the lives of 2 million children living in extreme poverty are being transformed. Michelle in the Philippines, who now runs her own NGO to help victims of human trafficking, is one example of many other former sponsored children who are now changing the lives of many other children.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thanks again for your generous commitment.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Best regards,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Carole Rochat\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Sponsor and Donor services\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Compassion Switzerland\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"boy\" t-value=\"child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"letters\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;correspondence&#x27;].search([(&#x27;sponsorship_id&#x27;, &#x27;in&#x27;, sponsorships.ids), (&#x27;scanned_date&#x27;, &#x27;&gt;=&#x27;, (datetime.datetime.now() - relativedelta(months=3)).strftime(&#x27;%Y-%m-%d&#x27;)), (&#x27;direction&#x27;, &#x27;=&#x27;, &#x27;Supporter To Beneficiary&#x27;)])\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"month\" t-value=\"child.get_date(&#x27;birthdate&#x27;, &#x27;date_month&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"already_paid\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;birthday_paid&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"paid_date\" t-value=\"already_paid and already_paid[0] and already_paid[0].get_date(&#x27;date_partner_paid&#x27;, &#x27;date_full&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"hold_gifts\" t-value=\"child.get_hold_gifts()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"send_gifts_to\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(sponsorships[0].send_gifts_to)[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"does_write\" t-value=\"partner == sponsorships[0].correspondent_id and 23 not in partner.category_id.ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Domani è il compleanno di <t t-out=\"name\"></t>, compirà <t t-out=\"child.age + 1\"></t> anni!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie al <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"></t> sostegno, <t t-out=\"name\"></t> ha potuto partecipare alle attività del centro di accoglienza per un altro anno.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"does_write and not letters\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&#x27;Vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Ti&#x27;\"></t> invitiamo a prendere qualche minuto per augurar<t t-out=\"&#x27;gli&#x27; if boy else &#x27;le&#x27;\"></t> un felice compleanno e per inviar<t t-out=\"&#x27;gli&#x27; if boy else &#x27;le&#x27;\"></t> parole di apprezzamento e incoraggiamento. <t t-out=\"&#x27;Potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Puoi&#x27;\"></t> scriver<t t-out=\"&#x27;gli&#x27; if boy else &#x27;le&#x27;\"></t> direttamente online su\n"
"        <a t-attf-href=\"https://my.compassion.ch/r/Sdg?email={{partner.email}}&amp;pname={{partner.name}}&amp;sponsor_ref={{partner.ref}}&amp;child_ref={{child.local_id if len(child) == 1 else ''}}\">\n"
"            mycompassion.ch\n"
"        </a>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"not hold_gifts and not already_paid and send_gifts_to == partner\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Se <t t-out=\"&#x27;desiderate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;desideri&#x27;\"></t> far<t t-out=\"&#x27;gli&#x27; if boy else &#x27;le&#x27;\"></t> un regalo di compleanno, <t t-out=\"&#x27;potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;puoi&#x27;\"></t> farlo utilizzando il bollettino di versamento allegato o direttamente online:\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/offrire/\">\n"
"            compassion.ch/it/offrire\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie per aver investito nel migliorare la vita di <t t-out=\"name\"></t> e per contribuire a cambiarla in modo duraturo.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti,\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    * Questa comunicazione potrebbe essere stata inviata contemporaneamente a una lettera, a un biglietto di auguri o a una donazione per un regalo di compleanno da parte <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostra&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tua&#x27;\"></t>. In questo caso, <t t-out=\"&#x27;potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;puoi&#x27;\"></t> semplicemente ignorarla. Grazie!\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.sms_confirmation_email_2
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.child_id\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"transaction_done\" t-value=\"sponsorship.state == &#x27;active&#x27;\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   Hello,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for your commitment towards <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>.\n"
"<t t-if=\"not transaction_done\">\n"
"Now that all information is completed, we will activate your sponsorship. <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t> will be informed as soon as you pay your first donation.\n"
"</t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   You will receive more documentation by post in the coming days. In the mean time, feel free to reach us if you have any question.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Best regards,\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"    Carole Rochat\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Sponsor and Donor services\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Compassion Switzerland\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.child_id\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"transaction_done\" t-value=\"sponsorship.state == &#x27;active&#x27;\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"  Ciao,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Grazie di cuore per il tuo impegno nella vita di <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>. Abbiamo ricevuto tutte le informazioni necessarie.\n"
"<t t-if=\"not transaction_done\">\n"
"    Il sostegno inizierà non appena riceveremo la conferma del primo versamento.\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Guarda nella tua buca delle lettere! Tra qualche giorno riceverai il dossier completo di <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t> con tutte le informazioni sul sostegno a distanza. Nel frattempo, non esitare a contattarci se hai domande sul sostegno.\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   Con i nostri più calorosi saluti,\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"Compassion Svizzera\n"
"<br/>\n"
"Noëmi Hänggi\n"
"<br/>\n"
"Dipartimento Sotenitori\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.sms_reminder_email
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"sponsorship.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.child_id\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"url\" t-value=\"&quot;%s/child/%s/sponsor/confirmation?face_reveal=1&quot; % (partner.get_base_url(), child.id)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   Hello,\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   3 days ago, you chose to invest in the life of <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   There are 2 steps left before <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> will be informed that you sponsor <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t>.                    Please consider finishing your request and you will begin to release <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t> from poverty, for a purposeful life.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   1.\n"
"   <a t-attf-href=\"{{url}}\" style=\"color:#0055A6;text-decoration: underline;\">\n"
"    Click here\n"
"   </a>\n"
"   to complete your information and your payment option.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   2. Your sponsorship will be activated when we receive your first payment.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   In the unlikely case you don't want to sponsor this child anymore, please contact us quickly by e-mail or by phone at 031 552 21 25. We will then try to find another sponsor for <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>.\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   A sponsorship changes a child's life forever. Michelle has grown in extrem poverty in the Philippines. She has been sponsored and created her own NGO to rescue human trafic victims.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Best regards\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"    Carole Rochat\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Sponsor and Donor services\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Compassion Switzerland\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"sponsorship.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.child_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"url\" t-value=\"&quot;%s/child/%s/sponsor/confirmation?face_reveal=1&quot; % (partner.get_base_url(), child.id)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie per aver deciso di investire nel migliorare la vita di <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Potete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Puoi&#x27;\"></t> inviarci i <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostri&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuoi&#x27;\"></t> dati completi <a t-attf-href=\"{{url}}\" style=\"color: #0055A6; text-decoration: underline;\">(<t t-out=\"&#x27;cliccate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;clicca&#x27;\"></t> qui)</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Se <t t-out=\"&#x27;avete&#x27; if plural else &#x27;hai&#x27;\"></t> ancora domande, contatta<t t-out=\"&#x27;te&#x27; if plural\"></t>ci all'indirizzo <a href=\"mailto:info@compassion.ch\">info@compassion.ch</a> o al numero 042 434 21 24.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"&#x27;Vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Ti&#x27;\"></t> invieremo un'e-mail non appena avremo ricevuto i <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostri&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuoi&#x27;\"></t> dati.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Insieme, contribuiamo a cambiare il mondo, un bambino alla volta!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"whatsapp_signature\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_welcome_activation
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"intro\" t-value=\"&#x27;a child&#x27; if len(partner.sponsorship_ids) == 1 else &#x27;a new child&#x27;\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for recently deciding to become a sponsor of Compassion. Thank you for your commitment to a child in extreme poverty. That’s how we change the world - one child after another.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We hope you have received the information package and have had time to read through the materials so that you are well-informed about your sponsorship.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   On our website, www.compassion.ch, you will find many testimonies that show the effectiveness of sponsorship.\n"
"   <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/en/jennifer/\">\n"
"    For example, Jennifer\n"
"   </a>\n"
"   and further information about the program can be found under the heading, “Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)”.  If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact us directly.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We wish you much joy with your sponsorship of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Best regards,\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.user_id.preferred_name\"></t><t t-out=\"object.user_id.lastname\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.user_id.employee_ids.department_id.name\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.user_id.company_id.address_name\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"PS: Do you already have the Compassion App? With it you always have your godchild's pictures, letters and all information with you. And the letter writing is made even easier. Download here: www.compassion.ch/app\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    \n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    \n"
"<t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    \n"
"<t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"object.partner_id.title.plural or object.partner_id.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Grazie di aver preso recentemente, la decisione di sostenere un bambino. Ci auguriamo che <t t-out=\"&#x27;abbiate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;abbia&#x27;\"></t> ricevuto il dossier di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> inviato<t t-out=\"&#x27;vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;le&#x27;\"></t> e che <t t-out=\"&#x27;abbiate&#x27; if plural else &#x27;abbia&#x27;\"></t> avuto il tempo di leggerlo. In questo modo il sostegno potrà iniziare nelle migliori condizioni possibili.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/notizie/\">\n"
"    Sul nostro sito internet\n"
"   </a>\n"
"   sono disponibili numerose testimonianze di ex bimbi Compassion iscritti al programma \"sostegno a distanza\".\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/domande-frequenti/\">\n"
"    Nella sezione (FAQ)\n"
"   </a>\n"
"   si possono trovare invece, risposte a domande che spesso riceviamo dai sostenitori. Per qualsiasi dubbio, richiesta o assistenza, restiamo sempre a disposizione!\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Scrivere a <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> parole incoraggianti e personali è essenziale per il sostegno. Ricordiamo che è possibile farlo\n"
"   <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/scrivere/\">\n"
"    dal sito web\n"
"   </a>\n"
"   o comodamente dopo avere scaricato\n"
"   <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/lapp-di-compassion-svizzera/\" title=\"\">\n"
"    l'APP gratuita di Compassion Svizzera\n"
"   </a>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"&#x27;Vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Le&#x27;\"></t> auguriamo tanta gioia nel <t t-out=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;suo&#x27;\"></t> rapporto con <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Grazie a <t t-out=\"&#x27;voi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;lei&#x27;\"></t>, il mondo cambierà un pò di più, un bambino alla volta. Grazie!\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   I nostri più sinceri e calorosi saluti.\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"     <t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>P.S. Ha già l'App di Compassion? Caricare le foto, le lettere e tutte le informazioni del suo bambino sul suo cellulare. Scrivere non è mai stato così facile! Per scaricare la App: https://compassion.ch/it/app\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_anniversary_1
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Congratulations!\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Now it‘s already been a year since you have gotten to know <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> and supported <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> as a sponsor.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for your commitment to  <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>. With your help, <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> life has changed.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Together with you as a sponsor, Compassion and 8,600 local churches; we are releasing 2.3 million children from extreme poverty.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you!\n"
"  </p>\n"
" <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"te\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;te&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;tu&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tua\" t-value=\"&quot;vostra&quot; if plural else &quot;tua&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tuo\" t-value=\"&quot;vostro&quot; if plural else &quot;tuo&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tue\" t-value=\"&quot;vostre&quot; if plural else &quot;tue&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ti\" t-value=\"&quot;vi&quot; if plural else &quot;ti&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)    \"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Congratulazioni !\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    È passato un anno da quando <t t-out=\"&quot;avete&quot; if plural else &quot;hai&quot;\"></t> conosciuto <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> e <t t-out=\"child.get(&quot;lo&quot;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"&quot;sostenete&quot; if plural else &quot;sostieni&quot;\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie al <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> aiuto, la sua vita sta cambiando.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Insieme a <t t-out=\"te\"></t> e a circa <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> chiese partner locali, stiamo al momento liberando più di <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> milioni di bambini dalla povertà estrema.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Questo è un motivo meraviglioso per festeggiare! Grazie di cuore per la fiducia e per dare speranza alla vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    A presto!\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_anniversary_10
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   Can you believe it‘s been 10 years since you have been sponsoring <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>? Congratulations for your wonderful commitment!\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Through your dedication, the life of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> has already changed tremendously. After more than 70 years of experience with child sponsorships, we know that long-term commitment brings lasting sustainable benefits. <t t-out=\"object.success_sentence or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We thank you greatly for believing with us that poverty does not have to be predestined. And that the life of a child, their family and the local community will change if we invest in a child‘s life.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   With Warmest Regards,\n"
"  </p>\n"
" <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"te\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;te&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;tu&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tua\" t-value=\"&quot;vostra&quot; if plural else &quot;tua&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tuo\" t-value=\"&quot;vostro&quot; if plural else &quot;tuo&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tue\" t-value=\"&quot;vostre&quot; if plural else &quot;tue&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ti\" t-value=\"&quot;vi&quot; if plural else &quot;ti&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Semplicemente Fantastico!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Ci <t t-out=\"&quot;credete&quot; if plural else &quot;credi&quot;\"></t> che <t t-out=\"&quot;state&quot; if plural else &quot;stai&quot;\"></t> sostenendo <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> da 10 anni ormai!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Con <t t-out=\"years_lc\"></t> <t t-out=\"number_years\"></t> anni di esperienza nel programma di sostegno a distanza, sappiamo che un impegno a lungo termine fa una differenza incredibile nella vita di un bambino.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Il <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> impegno, la <t t-out=\"tua\"></t> costanza nella vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> dona speranza e nuove prospettive per un futuro liber<t t-out=\"child.get(&quot;accord_o_a&quot;)\"></t> dalla povertà. E non solo per se stess<t t-out=\"child.get(&quot;accord_o_a&quot;)\"></t>, ma per tutta la famiglia e la sua comunità.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie, per questa enorme differenza che <t t-out=\"&quot;state&quot; if plural else &quot;stai&quot;\"></t> facendo nella vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Tutto questo è prezioso,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cordialmente\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_anniversary_15
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   This year, we would like to celebrate a special event with you: 15 years ago, you decided to change a life forever. You decided to sponsor <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>. much has been accomplished since then.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Your loyalty, your generous support and your contact in their lives will continue to change the life of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> drastically and in a sustainable way.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We would like to thank you from our hearts for your commitment. Together with you and many sponsors, we are in the process of releasing 2,3 million children from extreme poverty.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Best regards,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"<t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"te\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;te&quot;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;tu&quot;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"tua\" t-value=\"&quot;vostra&quot; if plural else &quot;tua&quot;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"tuo\" t-value=\"&quot;vostro&quot; if plural else &quot;tuo&quot;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"tue\" t-value=\"&quot;vostre&quot; if plural else &quot;tue&quot;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"ti\" t-value=\"&quot;vi&quot; if plural else &quot;ti&quot;\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)                   \"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
" </p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  Quindici anni fa, <t t-out=\"&quot;avete&quot; if plural else &quot;hai&quot;\"></t> deciso di cambiare una vita per sempre - la vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"  </p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"&quot;Pensate&quot; if plural else &quot;Pensa&quot;\"></t> per un momento a tutto quello che è successo da allora. Non è motivo per una grande celebrazione?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  Grazie al <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> sostegno, <t t-out=\"&quot;state&quot; if plural else &quot;stai&quot;\"></t> permettendo a <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> di assumersi le proprie responsabilità, di sviluppare doni, capacità e talenti. Questa è la base per una vita indipendente, piena di speranza e futuro.\n"
"  </p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Grazie per questo investimento duraturo nella vita di <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>! Insieme stiamo cambiando il mondo! Un bambino alla volta. Grati di farlo al <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> fianco.\n"
"  </p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Benedizioni!\n"
"</p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_anniversary_3
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   We want to celebrate your anniversary together with you!\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   It‘s been 3 years since you decided to support <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> with a sponsorship to free <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> from extreme poverty.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Through your support, you not only provide <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> with solid assistance, but you‘re also expanding the horizon for <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t>. Thank you for investing in the contact with your sponsored child!\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Together with you as sponsors, Compassion and 8,600 local churches; we are liberating 2.3 million children from extreme poverty.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you so very much!\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"te\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;te&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&quot;voi&quot; if plural else &quot;tu&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tua\" t-value=\"&quot;vostra&quot; if plural else &quot;tua&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tuo\" t-value=\"&quot;vostro&quot; if plural else &quot;tuo&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tue\" t-value=\"&quot;vostre&quot; if plural else &quot;tue&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ti\" t-value=\"&quot;vi&quot; if plural else &quot;ti&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Meravigliosa giornata di gioia! \n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Sono passati 3 anni da quando <t t-out=\"&quot;avete&quot; if plural else &quot;hai&quot;\"></t> iniziato a sostenere <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> per liberar<t t-out=\"child.get(&quot;lo&quot;)\"></t> dalla povertà estrema. È fantastico.  \n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Il sostegno a distanza è molto di più di un supporto finanziario. Con la <t t-out=\"tua\"></t> generosità <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> sa che dall’altra parte del mondo qualcuno <t t-out=\"child.get(&quot;lo&quot;)\"></t> ha nel cuore. E si preoccupa per <t t-out=\"child.get(&quot;lui&quot;)\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Questo è un dono dal valore inestimabile. Grazie per investire nella sua vita con il programma del sostegno a distanza.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie per la <t t-out=\"tua\"></t> fiducia in tutti questi anni. Insieme a <t t-out=\"te\"></t> e a circa <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> chiese partner locali, stiamo liberando al momento, più di <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> milioni di bambini dalla povertà estrema.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Con i nostri migliori auguri.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_new_donors_onboarding_postcard_and_magazine
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"is_plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"hast\" t-value=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"kennst\" t-value=\"&#x27;kennt&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;kennst&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"Melde\" t-value=\"&#x27;Meldet&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;Melde&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    Danke!\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    Wir freuen uns, <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> das aktuelle Compassion-Magazin zu senden. Einmal pro Jahr berichten wir in diesem Format über den Impact, den wir gemeinsam erreicht haben, was unsere Herausforderungen und Ziele sind und was Menschen im globalen Süden und in der Schweiz bewegt. Viel Freude beim Schmökern und Entdecken!\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    Wenn <t t-out=\"du\"></t> Compassion noch nicht <t t-out=\"kennst\"></t>, <t t-out=\"hast\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> vielleicht noch viele Fragen. <t t-out=\"Melde\"></t> <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> gerne jederzeit bei uns.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    Herzliche Grüsse\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    Debora Alder-Gasser und das Team von Compassion\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29 or not partner.title\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Siamo felici di inviar<t t-out=\"&quot;v&quot; if plural else &quot;t&quot;\"></t>i l’ultimo numero della rivista\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"partner.country_id.name != &#x27;Suisse&#x27; and partner.country_id.name != False and partner.country_id.name != &#x27;Liechtenstein&#x27;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/download/?e-filter-e27dc5c-download-cat=notizie\">Magazine Compassion</a>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Magazine Compassion.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Scoprir<t t-out=\"&quot;ete&quot; if plural else &quot;ai&quot;\"></t> una panoramica dell'impatto che abbiamo ottenuto insieme, delle sfide di Compassion e di ciò che motiva le persone nel Sud del mondo e in Svizzera. Buona lettura!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Non conosc<t t-out=\"&quot;ete&quot; if plural else &quot;i&quot;\"></t> ancora bene Compassion? Potrest<t t-out=\"&quot;e&quot; if plural else &quot;i&quot;\"></t> avere domande sul nostro impegno e sul nostro lavoro. Non esita<t t-out=\"&quot;t&quot; if plural else &quot;r&quot;\"></t>e a contattarci.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"% endif</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_new_donors_onboarding_2nd_blog_post
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><p>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"is_plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"du_upper\" t-value=\"&#x27;Ihr&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;Du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"findest\" t-value=\"&#x27;findet&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;findest&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"fragst\" t-value=\"&#x27;fragt&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;fragst&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"base_url\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].sudo().get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"du_upper\"></t> <t t-out=\"fragst\"></t> <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> vielleicht: \"Kinderpatenschaften kommen mir ein bisschen altmodisch vor. Sind sie wirklich noch relevant?\"\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Es wird <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> wahrscheinlich nicht überraschen, dass wir hier bei Compassion sagen, dass Kinderpatenschaften relevanter sind als je zuvor. Mit fast 70 Jahren Erfahrung glauben wir immer noch, dass eine Kinderpatenschaft eine lohnenswerte Investition ist, die effektiv, nachhaltig und engagiert ist - sogar in Krisenzeiten wie einer globalen Pandemie. Aber warum? Lass es uns gemeinsam auspacken.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <!-- TODO add link      -->\n"
"                    <a href=\"#\">Weiterlesen</a>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Hier <t t-out=\"findest\"></t> <t t-out=\"du\"></t> Kinder, für die wir gerade dringend einen Paten oder eine Patin suchen.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/finden-sie-ein-patenkind/?utm_event=sponsorshipheaderbutton\">Ja, ich möchte ein Kind mit einer Patenschaft unterstützen</a>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Nochmals vielen Dank, denn gemeinsam verändern wir das Leben von Kindern - eins nach dem anderen.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Herzliche Grüsse\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Debora Alder-Gasser und das Team von Compassion\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Du erhältst diese E-Mail, weil du gemeinsam mit Compassion Schweiz gegen extreme Armut kämpfst und die Arbeit mit einer Spende unterstützt hast. Du kannst dich jederzeit vom <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url}}/onboarding/new_donors/unsubscribe/{{partner.onboarding_new_donor_hash}}\">Nachrichtenversand abmelden</a>.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><p>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29 or not partner.title\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"base_url\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].sudo().get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_unacceptable_conditions&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Forse <t t-out=\"&quot;vi starete&quot; if plural else &quot;ti starai&quot;\"></t> chiedendo se il sostegno a distanza di un bambino è ancora rilevante in questi tempi. Probabilmente non <t t-out=\"&quot;sarete sorpresi&quot; if plural else &quot;ti sorprenderà&quot;\"></t> di sapere che qui a Compassion, diciamo che il programma di sostegnoa distanza dei bambini è una forma di assistenza allo sviluppo più importante che mai. \n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Con <t t-out=\"years_lc\"></t> <t t-out=\"number_years\"></t> anni di esperienza, crediamo ancora che questo programma <b>è un investimento utile, efficace e duraturo</b>, anche in tempi di crisi come una pandemia globale. Ma perché? Diamo un'occhiata più da vicino.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    </p><div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center;  text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/il-sostegno-a-distanza-e-ancora-rilevante-oggi/\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            Leggi di più\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Qui <t t-out=\"&quot;troverete&quot; if plural else &quot;troverai&quot;\"></t> i bambini per i quali stiamo cercando urgentemente un sostenitore.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/sostegno-individuale/sostieni-un-bambino/\">Sì, <t t-out=\"&quot;vorremmo&quot; if plural else &quot;vorrei&quot;\"></t> sostenere un bambino con il sostegno a distanza</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie ancora, perché insieme stiamo cambiando la vita dei bambini - uno alla volta.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Un buon tempo e a presto!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Se vuoi annullare l'iscrizione alla nostra newsletter <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url}}/onboarding/new_donors/unsubscribe/{{partner.onboarding_new_donor_hash}}\">clicca qui.</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_new_donors_onboarding_1st_blog_post
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><p>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"is_plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"du_upper\" t-value=\"&#x27;Ihr&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;Du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"hast\" t-value=\"&#x27;habt&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;hast&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"fragst\" t-value=\"&#x27;fragt&#x27; if is_plural else &#x27;fragst&#x27;\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"base_url\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].sudo().get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Wir freuen uns, <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> kennenzulernen und <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> mehr davon zu erzählen, wie wir Kinder und Familien unterstützen, extreme Armut zu überwinden. <t t-out=\"du_upper\"></t> <t t-out=\"fragst\"></t> <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> vielleicht, was Kinderpatenschaften bringen, vielleicht sogar, ob sie sinnvoll sind oder ob nur christliche Kinder unterstützt werden? Gerne nehmen wir <t t-out=\"dich\"></t> mit und beantworten <t t-out=\"deine\"></t> Fragen.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <!-- TODO add link -->\n"
"                    <a href=\"#\">Weiterlesen</a>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Nochmals vielen Dank: mit <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> zusammen befreien wir zurzeit mit rund 8'000 Partnerkirchen in 25 Ländern 2,2 Millionen Kinder aus extremer Armut. Gemeinsam ermöglichen wir den Kindern ein Leben mit Hoffnung und Zukunft.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Herzliche Grüsse\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Debora Alder-Gasser und das Team von Compassion\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Du erhältst diese E-Mail, weil du gemeinsam mit Compassion Schweiz gegen extreme Armut kämpfst und die Arbeit mit einer Spende unterstützt hast. Du kannst dich jederzeit vom <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url}}/onboarding/new_donors/unsubscribe/{{partner.onboarding_new_donor_hash}}\">Nachrichtenversand abmelden</a>.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><p>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"base_url\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].sudo().get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_unacceptable_conditions&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Non vediamo l'ora di <t t-out=\"&quot;incontrarvi e dirvi&quot; if plural else &quot;incontrarti e dirti&quot;\"></t> di più su come sosteniamo i bambini e le famiglie per superare la povertà estrema. <t t-out=\"&quot;Vi starete&quot; if plural else &quot;Ti starai&quot;\"></t> chiedendo in cosa consiste il sostegno a distanza, se ha senso o se vengono sostenuti solo bambini cristiani? Saremo felici di <t t-out=\"&quot;portarvi&quot; if plural else &quot;portarti&quot;\"></t> con noi e di rispondere a tutte le domande.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    </p><div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center;  text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/it/nuovo-a-compassion/\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            Leggi di più\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grazie ancora: insieme stiamo attualmente sollevando <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> milioni di bambini dalla povertà estrema con circa <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> chiese partner locali  in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> paesi. E sempre insieme permettiamo ai bambini di vivere con speranza e futuro. \n"
"\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    I nostri migliori auguri!\n"
"</p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Se vuoi annullare l'iscrizione alla nostra newsletter <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url}}/onboarding/new_donors/unsubscribe/{{partner.onboarding_new_donor_hash}}\">clicca qui.</a>\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_certificate
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><p>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&quot;child_id&quot;).get_list(&quot;preferred_name&quot;)\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    We recently informed you by email about the end of the sponsorship of <t t-out=\"name\"></t>.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    From the bottom of our hearts, we would like to thank you for your valuable contribution!\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Best regards\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"Ti\" t-value=\"&#x27;Vi&#x27; if plural else &#x27;Ti&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tuo\" t-value=\"&#x27;vostro&#x27; if plural else &#x27;tuo&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&quot;child_id&quot;).get_list(&quot;preferred_name&quot;)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"Ti\"></t> abbiamo recentemente informato via e-mail che il sostegno di <t t-out=\"name\"></t> è giunto al termine.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"Ti\"></t> ringraziamo di cuore per il <t t-out=\"tuo\"></t> prezioso impegno al nostro fianco!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Cari saluti,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

